# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fixly environment variables.
# Copy to apps/web/.env.local for the web app, or export in your shell for the
# validation script / extension host. Everything here is OPTIONAL — Fixly runs
# with none of these set.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- GitHub API ---
# Server-side only. Raises GitHub's rate limit (~60/hour unauthenticated to
# ~5,000/hour) when reading public-repo manifests. A classic token with no
# scopes, or a fine-grained token with public-repo read access, is enough.
# Never exposed to the browser.
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# --- OSV API ---
# No configuration needed: the OSV endpoint (api.osv.dev) requires no key.

# --- NVD API ---
# Not implemented yet — OSV is the only live source (see
# docs/vulnerability-sources.md). No variable is read today.

# --- Fixly scanner flags ---
# Disable the in-memory scan cache (the dev/demo cache that returns repeated
# same-URL scans for ~5 minutes, per process). Uncomment to turn it off:
# FIXLY_DISABLE_SCAN_CACHE=1

# --- Web app ---
# No web-specific variables are required.
